Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 22:38:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1141/1177] Slider curves in the Creator; the cover's overlay
 as large as its picture; the fold's gap (1166, part twenty)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «…кривую в виде арки/параболы, либо амплитуду вручную мышкой двигая вспышки и
затухания по слайдеру»; «Slider curves делай и тестируй. В гайды также добавь концепт».

A slider's row shows its curve small; a click opens its editor under the row: Flat, Arch, Draw.
In Draw a point dragged up is a flare, down a fade, along the song a move; a double-click adds a
point, on a point takes it out. The curve eases between points as the engine does (half a
cosine). The request carries it only where it is not flat (a flat slider's request as before);
a take's settings bring it back; its info says «curved». YueSliders.body() for the page test (two
checks: the editor, Arch sent, flat as before; Draw's point added and dragged to a fade). The
engine side: the commit before.

Also: the cover's overlay takes its picture's own size (Viktor: «при 1024 обложке попап
растягивался до 1024x1024»), 1024 for the painter's new pictures, 768 for the earlier, within
the window; the workspaces' « on an edge as wide as itself with a gap beside it (Viktor:
«Сделай отступ от кнопочки сворачивания, чтобы не наслаивалось впритык MADE»: it was 0 px, now
11; the other rooms' fold buttons 10 px and more). The words in the seven languages (9 keys).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
